From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 02:57:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Capture: accuracy measured from audio, working large-v3-turbo
 registry entry

evals/audio/ posts synthetic clips of the 59 eval cases to POST /transcribe on the
running server, feeds what Whisper heard through the real sorter, and reports word
error rate (raw and number-normalised), the end-to-end score, and which cases changed
against the clean-text run. Results for breeze-asr-25 and large-v3-turbo are stored
next to the runner; evals/audio/README.md has the numbers and their limits.

registry/models.yaml: the large-v3-turbo entry pointed at
Systran/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo, which does not exist. It now points at
dropbox-dash/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo (MIT), downloaded with the model manager
and used for the turbo results. The default model is unchanged.
